An assisted sleep-listening app for Android — spoiler-safe, landmark-based rewind for listening while falling asleep.

Mission (as of 2026-07-25 — pivoting): an assisted sleep-listening app for Android. Peter listens to audiobook readings to fall asleep; the app solves the four problems that breaks: (1) how long to set the sleep timer, (2) how to wind back to the last thing you actually registered before drifting off, (3) synopses for complex works, (4) reader notes (e.g. Shakespeare) interspersed with the text at the right moments. *Götterdämmerung on the Go* becomes the first fully-authored title and the template for the annotation format — not the product itself.
